# Content files

`content/` is the source of truth.

```json
// ✅ GOOD — change the JSON
{ "display": "050-877-7464" }

// ❌ BAD — hardcoding in a component
<a href="tel:0508777464">050-877-7464</a>
```

- Keep IDs stable (`sambusak-tuna`, `sun-wed`). Pages key off them.
- If a price or hour is uncertain, leave `needsConfirmation: true`.
- Do not delete categories to "clean up" the menu without owner approval.
